// BT-3690: open class whose class-side self-send sits in a conditional arm of
// a loop body, so each iteration also pays the arm's scope refresh (the
// BT-3683 fallback read of the enclosing scopes' commits).

Object subclass: SsbArmClass

  class foo -> Integer => 1

  class loop: n :: Integer -> Integer =>
    1 to: n do: [:i | i > 0 ifTrue: [self foo]]
    n
